meta {
  name: Register User
  type: http
  seq: 20
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/users/register?code={{functionKey}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  # Register User
  
  Registers a user in the local database after successful Entra External ID authentication.
  Creates a new user record if one doesn't exist, or returns the existing user.
  
  ## Authentication
  Requires a valid JWT token in the Authorization header (Bearer token).
  
  ## Request Body
  No request body needed - user information is extracted from the JWT token.
  
  ## Response Fields
  - `id` (guid): Internal user identifier
  - `externalIdObjectId` (string): Entra External ID object ID
  - `email` (string): User's email address
  - `displayName` (string): User's display name
  - `householdId` (guid, optional): ID of household the user belongs to
  - `householdName` (string, optional): Name of the household
  - `isAdmin` (bool): Whether the user is an admin of their household
  
  ## Error Responses
  - `400 Bad Request`: Missing required claims in token
  - `401 Unauthorized`: Invalid or missing authentication token
}
